ghborhoods, while connection levels vary spatially. Center/radius/boundary-port sensitivity below assesses whether one global threshold could reconcile these particular diagnostic levels; it is not exact junction ground truth.','All 625 examined field-patch pixels are unknown in partial real-material labels. Complementing only these patches changes neither branch of the image-wide material BCE.','Blue/yellow labeled-interior error is zero for thresholds 0.55 through 0.85, so this score cannot choose visible contact geometry.','256px letterboxed probabilities are bilinearly sampled into a 400px overlap. Upsampling adds no new evidence; the shallow RGB path means encoder stride alone does not establish the cause.'],'falsificationAndNextControls':['If the separated boundary-port connection levels collapsed under small center/radius shifts, the apparent variation could come from approximate neighborhood placement. Sensitivity results are included.','Pass an exact clean checker through only the saved camera/resampling chain and compute the same levels. Comparable spread would implicate sampling before learned segmentation; no retraining is needed.','In a future controlled development-only ablation, add phase-invariant visible-junction/edge supervision while holding body/interior labels and family groups fixed. Compare contact geometry and unchanged interior error; no gain is claimed here.'],'cases':results}
